New in this update:
• Mark sets as warm-up, drop or failure from their number. Warm-ups stay out of records, charts and the muscle map.
• Optional RPE: rate how hard each set felt (turn it on in Settings › Features).
• Add a note to a whole workout.
• Each finished workout shows the muscles it worked.
• Tap a column heading to fill it from the top set; tap ✓ to tick every set.
• Starting a workout while one is running now asks first.
